" hang\n- Purchases are verified one by one, so an expired purchase can no longer block a new one\n- Cancelling the Meta purchase sheet returns to the app at once\n- Ask: search in your own words across movies, series, live TV and the guide\n- Cloud restore shows live progress, with Continue in background\n- Extra devices add-on: 3 more devices on your account, up to 8\n- Match reminders and favorite-team alerts before kickoff\n- Device management offers Extra devices at any device count\n- The XR control bar shows the right title after switching versions\n- Large libraries open more reliably, and Continue Watching keeps one row per title when you switch versions", "created_date": 1794032967, "id": "28818135527851683", "version": "3.3.10", "version_code": 4179, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28818135527851683"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1793909469, "id": "28797836013214968", "version": "3.3.9", "version_code": 4175, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28818135527851683"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "- Programme reminders: set them in the Guide and get a banner before the start, synced across your devices\n- Sharper launch logo\n- Sports: stream quality chips on match channels, and the match's channels in the player\n- Live streams that end now reopen instead of replaying\n- Catch-up: scrub the progress bar\n- Player stats panel\n- Versions show their file sizes", "created_date": 1793576113, "id": "28742559585409278", "version": "3.3.9", "version_code": 4174, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28818135527851683"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "- Subtitle and audio sync, plus subtitle font, color and background\r\n- Switch episode or season without leaving the player\r\n- Aspect ratio presets: 16:9, 4:3, 21:9 and 1:1\r\n- Complete Sagas now shows one card per saga\r\n- Removed a false \"Channel down\" message during playback", "created_date": 1792991288, "id": "28648521208146450", "version": "3.3.8", "version_code": 4173, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28818135527851683"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "- New languages: Turkish, Italian, Polish and Swedish.\r\n- Sports now in your language: sports, countries, live match status, player positions and goal types.\r\n- More of the app follows your language: the Home highlight, the version picker, language badges, and episode and catch-up dates.\r\n- The XR 3D version menu is now in your language too.\r\n- Browse by Genre cards have fresh new icons.\r\n- TV Guide refreshes on its own after your playlist updates, keeps your guide if the provider sends an empty one, and shows a clear message with Retry if a download fails.\r\n- Fixed: the source card could wrongly say the guide update failed.\r\n- Today in sports on Home now opens at the first match instead of jumping to the end.\r\n- Leagues without highlights no longer show an empty highlights row.\r\n- Event channels can now be found by team nicknames and short codes.\r\n- Images load more smoothly and use less memory.\r\n- If your device language isn't supported, the app now uses English.", "created_date": 1792359328, "id": "28549643604700878", "version": "3.3.7", "version_code": 4172, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}